                  "note": "As trade and town life grew, inns and taverns became paid lodging and social spaces where travelers could sleep, eat, exchange news, and continue their journey.\nImage requirement + source guidance: The agent must use /imagesearch first. Because this slide refers to a real place, historical object, building, artwork, map, or named visual source, it must use a real image from a reliable source and must not generate a substitute. Prefer official site, museum/archive, Wikimedia Commons, or clearly licensed educational photography. Preserve the source link in the app. Search target: historic inn tavern medieval Europe public domain.",
