          "debateRelevance": "Useful when debating whether educational travel genuinely broadens people or mainly performs class, status, and cultural polish.",
          "counterargument": "Modern study abroad and gap years can resemble the Grand Tour, but they also differ because many travelers are not aristocrats and travel is far more accessible.",
