          "rawOfficialText": "Before 1985, you'd have had no idea how long it would take to install a program on your computer - or to save a file, or to complete an online form. (To be fair, there were no online forms.) Consider the history of the progress bar, then discuss with your team: what other activities and interactions in life would benefit from a progress bar?",
