          "debateRelevance": "Useful when debating whether demos are more authentic than finished tracks, or whether arrangement and production are part of the creative work itself.",
          "counterargument": "A demo can reveal process, but the final track may be stronger because collaboration and production solve problems the demo only suggests.",
