          "guidingSection": "Where We're Going, We'll Still Need Them",
          "rawOfficialText": "While the first long-distance car journey took place in Germany, it was in America that the concept of the road trip took hold. Read more about its history then discuss with your team: why is the idea of the road trip so associated with America even when other places also have expansive road systems? Is it because the country lacks trains and buses?",
